  "description": "CPD-2 catalog digests (docs/control-plane/02-lld.md §5.4), over RFC 8785 canonical JSON. Generated by Python (app.control_plane.catalog.digests); app tests (tests/unit/control_plane/test_digests.py) and Node (tests/modules/control-plane/digests.test.ts) both compute every digest here.",
  "rules": {
    "tool": "harness_core.mcp_hub.manifest.ToolDescriptor.digest (the one tool digest: run pins version 2, MCP approvals, the catalog): canonical digest of {name, description, inputSchema}, plus effect and sink when the tool declares them (absent or null: left out) and, under annotations, the MCP behaviour hints it declares (so an MCP tool's catalog digest is its approval digest); other members are ignored. contracts/harness/vectors/descriptor-pins.json (descriptor) holds the same function",
    "set": "canonical digest of {descriptorName: descriptorDigest}; names are unique",
    "skill": "canonical digest of {format: 'skill-bundle/1', files: {path: {sha256, size}}} = harness_core.skills.skill_bundle_digest over the bytes",
